HST Office: package and select the sparse HST command icon themes.

Reason: stock configure rejects hst; Automatic chooses a desktop theme; unknown
 dark themes fall straight back to light Colibre. Keep SymbolStyle=auto and its
existing profile precedence. Explicit choices and high contrast remain intact.
Use the existing cross-platform icon override hook to build deterministic SVG
archives; the standard postprocess package and ooo_images installer carry them.
Dark also counts when a GTK theme is dark without its prefer-dark flag, or when a
platform only names a dark theme. No VCL painting or widget metrics change. SVG-only preserves native HiDPI render.

Generated against bf6ef2662401c7d6dce671ab4deb26ee0af3a7c1; no earlier series patch
modifies these hunks. New selector test: make CppunitTest_vcl_app_test.
License: upstream files remain MPL-2.0.
